# What a docker build does not need from the repository root: it keeps the context small and the layers stable.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/
.git/
.github/
docs/
tests/
tools/
src/Nodeable.AppHost/
web/dist/
# web/e2e is needed: the web build is `tsc -b`, which type-checks the end-to-end project too.
web/test-results/
graphify-out/
*.md
!web/README.md
.env
.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
